topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_button3_state/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_button4_state/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_button5_state/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_channel/config
