topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_firmware_contract/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_heap/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_ip/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_mac/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_media/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_min_heap/config
topic write homeassistant/sensor/panel_living_room_min_psram/config
