# Trusted HA controller for this panel. Extend explicitly for other panels.
user homeassistant-walldisplay
topic read panel/living-room/#
topic write panel/living-room/set/#
topic write panel/living-room/cmd/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/status
topic read homeassistant/#
